  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Global Compact Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective aims at making African companies more resilient, competitive, and sustainability-driven by supporting the implementation of the UN Global Compact Africa Chapter in specific country Networks and the Regional Hub namely Kenya, Tanzania, South Africa, and Nigeria. Capacity building and promotion of compliance with international corporate sustainability standards are key results. In doing so, the project plans to contribute to increasing opportunities for African businesses in international trade and investment. This project is a continuation of a previous Danish contribution to the UNGC&#x2019;s implementation of its &#x201c;Africa Strategy.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
